For the purposes of this license, a project shall be considered to directly compete with Kursplan.se if its primary purpose and functionality are substantially similar to Kursplan.se and it is offered to the same or substantially similar target market as an alternative to Kursplan.se.

The developer may therefore reuse generic or generally applicable parts of the Software, including but not limited to:

