The developer may create, license, sell, distribute or otherwise commercially exploit projects containing permitted reused code, provided that the resulting project does not directly compete with Kursplan.se as defined above.

These developer rights shall survive termination of employment, engagement, ownership interest or other relationship between Liam Suorsa and Järnvägskonsulterna i Norden AB, unless otherwise agreed in writing by Liam Suorsa and Järnvägskonsulterna i Norden AB.

